Xvc2  vcp vcp k   vdd PMOS18 W=20u L=1u M=1            ;   cascode bias: x tracks the rail so
Xisk  vcp ibg_n  vss vss NMOS18 W=10u L=1u M=1            ;   the fold sources keep Vds at brownout)
