Xs2p  o2  pmd vdd vdd PMOS18 W=40u L=1u M=1
* --- stage 3: CMOS inverter (rail-to-rail digital out) ---
Xbp   out o2  vdd vdd PMOS18 W=20u L=0.5u M=1
Xbn   out o2  vss vss NMOS18 W=10u L=0.5u M=1
* --- enable / bias-shutdown disable (small switches; core on true rails) ---
Xei1p ENB   EN    vdd vdd PMOS18 W=4u L=0.5u M=1            ; ENB = /EN
